  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -AR verb; the non-reflexive \"lanzar\" means to throw/launch",
    "Spelling change: z→c before e, affecting only the **yo Pretérito Indefinido: me lancé**",
    "The same z→c change applies throughout the present subjunctive (me lance, te lances, etc.)",
    "All other forms follow regular -AR reflexive patterns",
    "Past participle: lanzado",
    "Figurative uses: lanzarse a un proyecto = to throw oneself into a project; lanzarse al vacío = to leap into the void"
